{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_24625615.mp3","text":"Kagô i ñgwel nye, a wo pôdô."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26073426.mp3","text":"Me ñédél ñwaa wem mbot."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_24625618.mp3","text":"A nnyoñg me le me pot bañ."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26073430.mp3","text":"Ñwel u hyéé hi nyoo u léli ñgéda yoso."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26160205.mp3","text":"Hikok hi nhéya ni kwade a nhoo."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26466773.mp3","text":"A nhue banyañ ba makabô."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26187663.mp3","text":"Jinda li binuga, jinda li bôt."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26131759.mp3","text":"Mut nunu a yé kom."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26160745.mp3","text":"Nseghe bijek."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26160493.mp3","text":"A nhémb nye kodi."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26466878.mp3","text":"Mapam ma suglu."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26466712.mp3","text":"Hiñgonda hi mboñ liñweñ."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26624678.mp3","text":"Bana bôt ba nyuugana bé."}
{"audio":"bas/unknown/bas_u_26160189.mp3","text":"U ntonda nunu mañge mudaa."}
